#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0288 expect=noViolation domain=TS
#note "ROW 0 RESOLVES NO CT PACKAGE (a MEDDRA row with a blank TSVCDVER); row 1 is a CDISC row whose TSVALCD C49488 IS in sdtmct-2024-09-27's Term CCODE set -> no violation, and EXECUTED, not ERROR: the aggregate binding answers the union over every row even when the dataset-level leaf is folded over row 0 alone (review round 1, H1)."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#library codelist-attributes sdtmct-2024-09-27 "Term CCODE" C49488 C66731
dataset TS
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col TSSEQ    type=Num
col TSPARMCD type=Char
col TSVAL    type=Char
col TSVCDREF type=Char
col TSVCDVER type=Char
col TSVALCD  type=Char
---
S1 | TS | 1 | INDIC   | HYPERTENSION | MEDDRA |            | 10020772
S1 | TS | 2 | SPECIES | HUMAN        | CDISC  | 2024-09-27 | C49488
